
## 📁 Project Structure

```
pet-clinic/
│
├── auth/              # JWT auth, middleware
├── db/                # Database connection files
├── handlers/          # Route handlers
├── models/            # Models / Structs
├── uploads/           # Uploaded files (images)
├── utils/             # Helper functions
│
├── .env               # Environment variables
├── app.log            # Log file
├── main.go            # Entry point
├── go.mod
└── go.sum
```

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔐 JWT Authentication  
- 🐶 Pet CRUD  
- 👨‍⚕️ Owner management  
- 📁 File uploads  
- 💾 Database integration  
- 🧰 Clean Go module structure  
- 📝 File logging  

---

##  Tech Stack

| Component | Technology |
|----------|------------|
| Language | Go 1.20+ |
| Auth | JWT |
| Database | MySQL / PostgreSQL |
| Logging | File logs |
| Tools | VS Code, Git, Postman |

---

## 🔑 Environment Variables

Your `.env` file should contain:

```
PORT=8080
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=yourpassword
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=3306
DB_NAME=pet_clinic
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
```

---

## ▶️ Run the Project

### Install modules
```
go mod tidy
```

### Start Server
```
go run main.go
```

---

## 🧪 API Endpoints

### Auth
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/auth/register` | Register |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Login |

### Pets
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/pets` | Add pet |
| GET | `/pets` | List pets |
| GET | `/pets/:id` | Get pet |
| PUT | `/pets/:id` | Update |
| DELETE | `/pets/:id` | Delete |

### Owners
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/owners` | Add owner |
| GET | `/owners` | List owners |



## 📦 Build Production Binary

```
go build -o petclinic
./petclinic
```

